From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elkir0 <elkir0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: configs: gts28ltexx: the kernel options Waydroid needs

The C binder with the static devices binder, hwbinder and vndbinder (no
binderfs), the iptables-legacy NAT, MASQUERADE, mangle and CHECKSUM
targets that waydroid-net.sh uses, squashfs (xattr, xz), tun, 802.1Q VLANs
and the bridge's VLAN filtering.

And a 3G/1G split instead of 2G/2G: 32-bit Android needs the 3 GiB of user
address space. With 2 GiB, ART could not map its boot image at 0x70000000
(the libraries were there) and system_server died on pthread_create
("Try again"), restarting zygote in a loop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig | 20 +++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
index 2c7d892c2..5d04c41a9 100644
--- a/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
@@ -58,7 +58,7 @@ CONFIG_ARCH_EXYNOS=y
 CONFIG_SOC_EXYNOS5433=y
 CONFIG_ARM_LPAE=y
 CONFIG_SMP=y
-CONFIG_VMSPLIT_2G=y
+CONFIG_VMSPLIT_3G=y
 CONFIG_NR_CPUS=8
 CONFIG_HIGHMEM=y
 CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=tty0 loglevel=8 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused panic=5 oops=panic s3c2410_wdt.tmr_atboot=1 exynos5433_sleep=dryrun"
@@ -367,3 +367,21 @@ CONFIG_SND_SOC_SAMSUNG_GTS28_WM1814=m
 CONFIG_SECURITY=y
 CONFIG_SECURITY_LANDLOCK=y
 CONFIG_LSM="landlock"
+
+# Waydroid (Android in an LXC container): the C binder with its three static
+# devices and no binderfs, as postmarketOS configures it; the iptables-legacy
+# NAT, mangle and CHECKSUM rules of waydroid-net.sh; squashfs for the
+# container tooling; tun, VLANs and the bridge's VLAN filtering.
+CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_IPC=y
+CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_DEVICES="binder,hwbinder,vndbinder"
+CONFIG_IP_NF_NAT=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_TARGET_MASQUERADE=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_TARGET_MASQUERADE=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_MANGLE=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_TARGET_CHECKSUM=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS_XATTR=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS_XZ=y
+CONFIG_TUN=y
+CONFIG_VLAN_8021Q=y
+CONFIG_BRIDGE_VLAN_FILTERING=y
-- 
